    "title": "Makerblox - Create Skins",
    "description": "Create a bright design and the most stylish avatar!\r\nOur team has designed the powerful app, allowing you to create your own clothing for skins! \r\n\r\nYou have never seen an app like this! \r\nNow you can make your own clothes for your avatar and load into the game!\r\n- Free\r\nYou no longer need to buy clothes for your avatar. Now you can create your own outfits, make and adopt them.\r\n- Simply\r\nDon't know any special programs? No problem, just use your phone and this editor and create as many clothes as you want!\r\n\r\n\u0421reate your clothes, hundreds of customized personalized options to match your creative inspiration, let you show your exclusive style in favourite game. Adopt your new outfits, they are waiting for you.\r\nApp Features:\r\n- You can create shirts, t-shirts, pants and clothing sets\r\n- You can make clothing for male or female avatar in different styles\r\n- Various stickers accessories: hoods, pockets, ties, scarves, jewelry, etc, to make your personal style distinctive\r\n- Lots of prints to make cool T-shirts\r\n- Lots of fabric textures to make your clothes look like real\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is a real dream! Imagine, now your character will have a lot of clothes in any style, absolutely free.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Create a bright design and the most stylish avatar!<br>Our team has designed the powerful app, allowing you to create your own clothing for skins! <br><br>You have never seen an app like this! <br>Now you can make your own clothes for your avatar and load into the game!<br>- Free<br>You no longer need to buy clothes for your avatar. Now you can create your own outfits, make and adopt them.<br>- Simply<br>Don&#39;t know any special programs? No problem, just use your phone and this editor and create as many clothes as you want!<br><br>\u0421reate your clothes, hundreds of customized personalized options to match your creative inspiration, let you show your exclusive style in favourite game. Adopt your new outfits, they are waiting for you.<br>App Features:<br>- You can create shirts, t-shirts, pants and clothing sets<br>- You can make clothing for male or female avatar in different styles<br>- Various stickers accessories: hoods, pockets, ties, scarves, jewelry, etc, to make your personal style distinctive<br>- Lots of prints to make cool T-shirts<br>- Lots of fabric textures to make your clothes look like real<br><br><br>This is a real dream! Imagine, now your character will have a lot of clothes in any style, absolutely free.",
